# Data — large files served from Google Drive at runtime
data/
*.parquet
*.joblib
*.npy

# ...except the frontend's precomputed static artifacts (project_refactor.md
# §25.3): the small JSON is meant to be committed to the frontend repo, and
# the two Parquet artifacts are committed here as the local stand-in for a
# real Cloudflare R2 bucket (no R2 credentials in this environment -- see
# WebArtifactsConfig's docstring in src/pricepoint/config.py).
!frontend/public/data/
!frontend/public/data/**
!frontend/public/data-r2/
!frontend/public/data-r2/**

